@startuml STATE-04
!include ../theme.puml
title STATE-04 — Vòng đời DeliveryAlbum
[*] --> DRAFT : create/get album
DRAFT --> DELIVERED : photographer deliver
DELIVERED --> ACCEPTED : customer confirm
DELIVERED --> REVISION_REQUESTED : customer requests revision
REVISION_REQUESTED --> DELIVERED : photographer redelivers
ACCEPTED --> [*]
note right of REVISION_REQUESTED
  Có thể cập nhật ảnh khi chưa ACCEPTED.
  Không có revision counter/history riêng.
end note
@enduml

